    _definition.id                'csp.structure_generation_stopping_criteria_space_group_number_list'
    _alias.definition_id          'csp_structure_generation_stopping_criteria_space_group_number_list'
    _definition.update            2026-04-10
    _description.text
    ;
    If different stopping criteria are used for each space group, it allows specify a single or a subset of space groups numbers in a loop.
    ;
    _name.category_id             'csp'
    _name.object_id               'structure_generation_stopping_criteria_space_group_number_list'
    _type.purpose                 Number
    _type.source                  Assigned
